    ],
    "text": "Do you usually get annoyed with the cooling of water during a relaxing bath? In this paper, several models are proposed to solve the problem. Our efforts in building these models followed the path below."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000010",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0022-l0000",
