    ],
    "text": "Secondly, taking convection caused by human movement and comfort of water temperature into account, we developed an optimization control model for the bath strategy (OCM) based on UTM, which aims at the smallest water injection, the best temperature stability & the highest comfort level. We use the model(OCM) to optimize the two following strategies\uff1ai. Injecting hot water constantly at a certain flow; ii. Injecting hot water when temperature declines to and stopping injecting when temperature increase to . In T T min1 min 2 0.007L s\uf02d strategy I, the optimal conditions are that the flow is and the temperature of \uf0d7 1"
  },
